WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:05.069
Have you ever wondered what SCP-5595, the
talking Gumball machine, wants?

00:00:05.069 --> 00:00:10.790
Foundation staff used SCP-978, The Desire
Camera, to take a picture of SCP-5595 while

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:12.990
it was conversing with Dir.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:13.990
Lague.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:14.990
This was the result:

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:19.840
"Standing behind a desk, with a name plate
atop it labeled "Site-Director Geoffrey Q.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:20.840
Harrison"."

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:24.650
It looks like SCP-5595 wishes it could be
a Site Director.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:26.370
Stranger things have happened!

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:31.920
If Dr. Bright can keep a job at the Foundation,
maybe there's hope for 5595's dream.

